# NWP met USER-LEVEL DR pull (ops#330) — user crontab block, not /etc/cron.d
# (rob on this host has no passwordless sudo; the root-level /srv/nwp-dr route
# is the operator's). Runs the VERSIONED scripts/met-dr-pull.sh from the
# checkout: dev (dev laptop curated export, rrsync-ro key with push-fallback
# while the laptop pull leg awaits its sshd) + the LIVE box's nightly
# /var/backups/nwp-pull (which had NO off-box consumer before this — ops#329
# D3/D5), both into the user restic repo ~/nwp-dr/repo with post-run
# freshness+size verification. Installed by scripts/install-dev-backup.sh.
# NWP met user DR pull - dev + live box (ops#330)
35 3 * * * NWP_GITLAB_HOST=<gitlab-host> NWP_OPS_LOG_PROJECT=11 NWP_DR_LIVE_SRC=<live-ssh-user>@<public-ip-redacted>: $HOME/nwp/scripts/met-dr-pull.sh all >> $HOME/logs/met-dr-pull.log 2>&1
